ttp://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5993393&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607257618" alt="Mikaelious" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5993393)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mikaelious" >Mikaelious</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wrongjohnsilver" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2000367&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607257618" alt="WrongJohnSilver" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2000367)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wrongjohnsilver" >WrongJohnSilver</a></span>. Sorry if I missed anybody!</p> 
