						 <p>A Holiday themed tale featuring SCP-5733. A tribute to all cheesy Christmas specials.</p> <p>Many thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anactualcrow" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6040770&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606952677" alt="AnActualCrow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6040770)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/anactualcrow" >AnActualCrow</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606952678" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5813664&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606952678" alt="PlaguePJP" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5813664)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" >PlaguePJP</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606952678" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span> for giving me the gift of critique.</p> 
